msgid "Enabling and starting docker service..."
msgstr "启用并启动 docker 服务..."

msgid "Current user is already in the docker group"
msgstr "当前用户已在 docker 组中"

msgid "Add user"
msgstr "是否将用户"

msgid "to the docker group (passwordless docker, requires re-login)?"
msgstr "加入 docker 组（免 sudo 使用 docker，需重新登录生效）？"

msgid ""
"Log out and back in (or run newgrp docker) for the change to take effect."
msgstr ""

